<title>USA: Liberty Bancorp sets 500,000 shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Liberty Bancorp sets 500,000 shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberty Bancorp Inc said on Wednesday its board of directors approved the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares or 5.3 percent of its common stock in the open market over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>The bank said the plan would not have a material effect on its capital levels.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
